  "body": "G.J. Gardner Homes House and Land Package featuring a Custom design.\r\n\r\nStep into contemporary living with this beautifully designed home, where premium finishes meet everyday comfort. Featuring light-filled open-plan living, quality craftsmanship, a stylish kitchen, and seamless indoor-outdoor flow, this home offers the perfect balance of luxury and practicality. Thoughtfully designed for modern families, it's ready for you to move in and enjoy. (408 characters)\r\n\r\nYour plan, our plans, or we can design from scratch. For more information visit our website http://www.gjgardner.co.nz\r\nMORE NEW ZEALANDERS TRUST G.J. GARDNER TO BUILD THEIR HOMES THAN ANY OTHER BUILDER.\r\n\r\nIf you’re thinking about building, make Home Prep the first step in your journey. It’s our essential step-by-step guide to the building process. Full of independent advice and handy information to help you have a great building experience. Get your free copy from gjgardner.co.nz today.\r\n\r\n*Price is an indication only and includes land. Some conditions may apply. Image is artist’s impression only.\r\n\r\nCopyright G.J. Gardner Homes",
